      2 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غيّبهُ</span></b>  (S, Msb, TA) <i>He caused him,</i> or <i>it, to
become absent,</i> or <i>to disappear;</i> or <i>he hid,</i> or <i>concealed, it,</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَنْهُ</span> <i>from him.</i> (TA.) See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غَيَابٌ</span>.
